; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): Tide Stalker — grade 3, comet pool.
; PLACEHOLDER descriptive id (fish re-skin later; identity
; data-keyed). *** TRUE PURSUER — sl-0200 EXPERIMENT 2 of 2 (the
; designer's word: "maybe 1 or 2 pursuiters"). The no-chase law is
; AMENDED to sanction exactly these two kits. FAIRNESS IS
; STRUCTURAL: pursuit speed 2.4/2.8/3.2 — STRICTLY below the 3.6
; player floor at EVERY phase (pressure, never cornering; the
; gather_test pursuer pins enforce the ceiling; the corner-audit
; proof walks the worst pocket). *** The heavy shape: slow wake
; rings pulse off the advance — the room fills BEHIND the pursuit
; and crossing a wake is the play. Contact 0 like the whole rift
; family. hp 490 = 45s at the g3 spine (20-60s INTENSE; GATE 7).
; One lead per pattern; every number [T]; lunge/stamina cycles
; deliberately NOT taken (data-pure experiment).

